    "['mpls', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls interface all', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set protocols mpls interface all', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset protocols mpls interface all\\n##\\n\\nAlternatively, if you want to be more specific about the interfaces (similar to the Huawei configuration where MPLS is enabled on specific interfaces), you could use:\\n##\\nset protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/1.0\\nset protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/3.0\\n##\\n\\nNote: The first translation enables MPLS on all interfaces, while the second specifically enables it on the two interfaces mentioned in the Huawei config (equivalent to GE1/0/1 and GE1/0/3). Choose based on your network requirements.', 'trans_template': None}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/1.0', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/1.0', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset protocols mpls interface all\\n##\\n\\nAlternatively, if you want to be more specific about the interfaces (similar to the Huawei configuration where MPLS is enabled on specific interfaces), you could use:\\n##\\nset protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/1.0\\nset protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/3.0\\n##\\n\\nNote: The first translation enables MPLS on all interfaces, while the second specifically enables it on the two interfaces mentioned in the Huawei config (equivalent to GE1/0/1 and GE1/0/3). Choose based on your network requirements.', 'trans_template': None}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/3.0', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/3.0', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset protocols mpls interface all\\n##\\n\\nAlternatively, if you want to be more specific about the interfaces (similar to the Huawei configuration where MPLS is enabled on specific interfaces), you could use:\\n##\\nset protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/1.0\\nset protocols mpls interfac